This is a static portfolio website created using HTML and CSS only.
It has a nav bar, links, images etc.
I have used sementic html tags wherever necessary for better readability of code.
I have created progress bars using divs, and flexbox properties.

Skills covered in this project:
i) HTML
> Use of Sementic tags.
> creating nav bar.
> adding images.
> adding SVGs and unicodes.

ii) CSS
> Using color pallates.
> Using color gradients.
> Using Google fonts.
> Using flexbox.
